# **Giants and gnomes**
With this datapack/mod you can be a giant, a dwarf, or remain human. Each race has its own advantages and disadvantages, so it will be unusual to change your size. You can also play with friends, choosing different races, for example. I also changed most of the attributes to make them more suitable!


## **To make datapack work:**

Join a team which you need:

```
/team join giant/gnome/human <player>
```
  (pick one race of three)

_**!!! To apply you need to type (because I cant fix that yet):**_   
```
/function #minecraft:tick

or /function trs:tick
```

### List of attributes:
_scale; 
jump_strength; 
movement_speed; 
step_height; 
attack_speed; 
safe_fall_distance; 
fall_damage_multiplier; 
block_break_speed; 
block_interaction_range; 
entity_interaction_range; 
camera_distance; 
knockback_resistance; 
oxygen_bonus; 
burning_time; 
attack_knockback._

You can also modify these teams, ex:



```
/team modify humans color gold
```

(to change color of nicknames of humans to gold)
